{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026m7ECNO0JZv1795834969.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中九龍繞道下月6日全線開通，西行路段、即將軍澳直達油麻地，中途不設出口往九龍灣，土木工程拓展署指，是考慮到分流作用。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.RTHK.BYPASS.BITE 0930_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KhItqawMZw1795835138.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>土木工程拓展署東拓展處處長梁中立說：「一些快速道路的設計，是盡量希望減少出入口，若越多出入口，會將路網設計效率降低。我們討論過，似乎不設出入口是更優勝，所以能起分流作用，跨區車走新路，而現有的例如將軍澳居民，目的地是前往九龍灣MegaBox用餐，或前往觀塘看電影，就會走將軍澳隧道，或將藍隧道在茶果嶺出，其實開了新路後會更快，幹道的紅利會釋放，不同的周邊地區同樣受惠。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T04:23:57.131788+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T02:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T08:49:41.322048+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:17.498612+00:00","content_hash":"c58faf65ab3a25f2e57a5809072b9f879cf597edf73583221f0949278e26a984","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T04:23:57.131788+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}